@startuml
autonumber

actor Dev as "DevOps Engineer"
participant GH as "GitHub\n(repo)"
participant GHA as "GitHub Actions\n(Workflows)"
participant TFC as "Terraform Cloud"
participant WS_EKS as "Workspace\n dsb-aws-devsecops-eks-cluster"
participant WS_PIPE as "Workspace\n dsb-aws-devsecops-pipelines"
participant AWS as "AWS APIs\n(IAM, VPC, EKS, CodePipeline...)"

Dev ->> GH: git push origin main
GH ->> GHA: Déclenchement workflow CI\non: push (main)

note over GHA
Job 1 (optionnel)\nLint/Format Terraform
end note

GHA -> GHA: terraform fmt -check

group Job terraform-apply-eks
  note over GHA, TFC
  Provisionnement du cluster EKS
  end note

  GHA -> GHA: Checkout repo (actions/checkout)
  GHA -> TFC: upload-configuration\n./terraform/eks-cluster\nworkspace = dsb-aws-devsecops-eks-cluster
  TFC --> GHA: configuration_version_id

  GHA -> TFC: create-run (apply-run)\navec TF_API_TOKEN (secret GitHub)
  TFC -> WS_EKS: Crée un run (plan)
  WS_EKS -> AWS: Appels API via provider AWS
  AWS --> WS_EKS: Résultat du plan (diff)

  WS_EKS --> TFC: Run avec actions.IsConfirmable = true
  GHA -> TFC: apply-run si IsConfirmable = true
  TFC -> WS_EKS: Application du plan
  WS_EKS -> AWS: Création / MAJ VPC, EKS, IAM...
  AWS --> WS_EKS: Ressources créées / mises à jour
end

group Job terraform-apply-pipelines (dépend de terraform-apply-eks)
  note over GHA, TFC
  Provisionnement des pipelines DevSecOps
  end note

  GHA -> TFC: upload-configuration\n./terraform/pipelines\nworkspace = dsb-aws-devsecops-pipelines
  TFC --> GHA: configuration_version_id

  GHA -> TFC: create-run
  TFC -> WS_PIPE: Crée un run (plan)
  WS_PIPE -> AWS: Appels API AWS\n(CodePipeline, CodeBuild, ECR, S3, EventBridge, SNS, Lambda…)
  AWS --> WS_PIPE: Plan de changements

  WS_PIPE --> TFC: Run confirmable
  GHA -> TFC: apply-run
  TFC -> WS_PIPE: Applique le plan
  WS_PIPE -> AWS: Création pipeline, projets CodeBuild,\nECR, S3, EventBridge, SNS, Lambda...
  AWS --> WS_PIPE: Infra DevSecOps provisionnée
end

AWS --> Dev: EKS + Pipelines prêts

@enduml